<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's NLCF seeks up to 40,000 tonnes soymeal.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's NLCF seeks up to 40,000 tonnes soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's National Livestock Cooperatives Federation (NCLF) said on Thursday it would invite tenders for 32,000-40,000 tonnes of soybean meal by 11:00 a.m. (0200 GMT) on Friday.</p>
<p>An NLCF official said arrival was set by July 20 to the three South Korean ports of Inchon, Kunsan and Ulsan.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5651</p>
